# Mneme builds the runtime image from `mneme-ai` on npm — we don't need
# any of the source from this monorepo in the build context. Excluding
# everything except what `Dockerfile` explicitly relies on keeps the
# context tiny (<10 KB) and speeds up CI builds significantly.

*

# Allowlist — only what the Dockerfile reads from the build context.
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
